Usage:
  minder datasource [flags]
  minder datasource [command]

Available Commands:
  apply       Apply a data source
  create      Create a data source
  delete      Delete a data source
  get         Get data source details
  list        List data sources

Flags:
  -h, --help             help for datasource
  -j, --project string   ID of the project

Global Flags:
      --config string            Config file (default is $PWD/config.yaml)
      --grpc-host string         Server host (default "api.custcodian.dev")
      --grpc-insecure            Allow establishing insecure connections
      --grpc-port int            Server port (default 443)
      --identity-client string   Identity server client ID (default "minder-cli")
      --identity-url string      Identity server issuer URL (default "https://auth.custcodian.dev")
  -v, --verbose                  Output additional messages to STDERR

Use "minder datasource [command] --help" for more information about a command.
